// A short scene in a kitchen. Each node is a conversation the game starts by name:
// kitchen.enter when the scene opens, and one node for each thing worth a look.
// Only kitchen.door has line IDs so far; `pibbles ids` adds the rest.

@prefix kitchen

== .enter
@show mira left
@show rex right
@if visits(.enter) > 1:
    rex: Back in the kitchen. Thrilling.
    @enter_room kitchen on_exit=.leave
    @end

mira (worried): This kitchen gives me the creeps.
rex (grumpy): It's a kitchen.{w 0.4} Relax.
mira (worried): Who said that?
rex: Rex. I live in the walls.{w} Kidding. I'm behind the fridge.
mira: Let's look around. Press {icon interact} to inspect things.
@enter_room kitchen on_exit=.leave

== .fridge
@sequence:
    - mira: It's a fridge.{@sfx fridge_hum} It hums. [wave]Ominously.[/wave]
    - mira (smug): Still a fridge.
    - mira: I refuse to look at this fridge again.

== .drawer
@once:
    mira: Spoons, spoons, more spoons, and...{w} [clue]a small brass key[/clue]!
    @set $has_key = true
    mira (happy): Press {icon inventory} to check your items.
    @end
mira: Just spoons now.

== .window
@if has_item("crowbar"):
    mira: I could pry it open... but the door's right there.
    @end
@cycle:
    - mira: Dusty.
    - mira: Very dusty.
        @wait 0.5s
        @sfx sneeze
        mira (angry): Ugh.
    - mira: When did anyone last clean this?
    - rex: You two stare at everything, don't you?

== .door #was:.front_door
@if $door_open:
    @jump .leave

// Deadpan. She's said this about every door so far.
mira (worried): Locked.{w} Of course it's locked. #id:k7qp2x

-> Rattle the handle #id:c4ne8r
    @sfx door_rattle
    @jolt mira
    mira (angry): [shout]Open up![/shout]{@shake_screen 0.5} #id:p2vd7t
    @set $bravery += 1
    @call common.stuck #id:r4hc6v
-> Use the key  @if $has_key #show_disabled #id:m3xw9a
    @sfx key_turn
    @set $door_open = true
    mira (happy): Got it! #id:h8ya3k
    @jump .leave
-> Knock politely  @once #id:t5bq2m
    rex (surprised): Did you just knock on a door you're trying to break open? #id:w9fz4e
    mira (smug): Manners matter, Rex. #id:d6kr8u
-> Leave it #id:x2jm5p
    @end

rex: {if $bravery > 2}Maybe stop hitting it?{else}Well, that didn't work.{/if} #id:q7gt3n

== .leave
@hide rex
@move mira offscreen nowait
mira (happy): Onward!
rex (surprised): Wait for m—
@camera hallway

== common.stuck
@cycle:
    - mira (sad): Nope.
    - mira (sad): Not that.
    - mira (sad): That's not it either.
